    "summary": "35a3a1ea: codeReviewRequestParams (src/shared/review-stream.ts) forwards fallbackReason; codeReview.run (src/daemon/code-review-rpc.ts) adds CodeReviewRunParams.fallbackReason, validates it in parseFallbackReason (refusing malformed reasons and one sent with a full review) and passes it to the degraded runCodeReview, whose buildArtifact stamps body.fallbackReason (t5). The step-to-daemon test drives the real handler, the real serializer over a JSON wire and the real codeReview.run and asserts the record's body.fallbackReason equals the done frame's. Seven falsifying mutations each fail a test. tsc clean. Full sweep 5578 pass; the 3 failures are pre-existing (sqlite-driver, review-decision) or the known MCPSection.test.ts sweep-load flake (passes 3/3 alone).",
